# Template for local macOS signing + notarization.
# Copy to apps/desktop/.env.signing (gitignored) and fill in, then run:
#   yarn desktop:package:mac:prod:signed
# Keep the .p8 key file OUTSIDE the repo.
#
# Notarization — App Store Connect API key (.p8). Use an ABSOLUTE path.
APPLE_API_KEY=/Users/you/keys/AuthKey_XXXXXXXXXX.p8
APPLE_API_KEY_ID=XXXXXXXXXX
APPLE_API_ISSUER=xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx

# Signing identity defaults to the Developer ID Application cert in your Keychain.
# To sign from a .p12 instead, set:
# CSC_LINK=/Users/you/keys/developer-id.p12
# CSC_KEY_PASSWORD=your-p12-password
